  "content_type": "paragraph",
  "content_text": "My principles\n[我的原则]\nI'm going to follow the 1,000-hour skill-learning method recommended by Li Xiaolai to study English.\n[接下来我将参考李笑来推荐的 1000 小时学习技能的方法来学习英语。]\nThe first part is about principles. Here are my current principles:\n[第一篇的内容是关于原则，我现在的原则：]\nI'm a long-term thinker who focuses on lasting value.\n[我是一个长期主义者，我关注长期价值；]\nI work hard before allowing myself to enjoy.\n[我先努力再享乐；]\nI take good care of my body.\n[我关爱自己的身体；]\nI embrace reality and face it positively.\n[我拥抱现实，积极面对现实；]\nI'm a lifelong learner who improves a little every day.\n[我是个终生学习者，每天都会进步一点点；]\nI confront pain and difficulties head-on.\n[我直面痛苦与困难；]\nI search actively instead of relying on algorithmic recommendations.\n[我主动搜索而不是依赖算法推荐；]\nI spend rationally.\n[我理性消费；]\nI treat desires properly.\n[我正确对待欲望；]\nI never get addicted to videos.\n[我从不沉迷于视频；]\nI never binge eat or drink.\n[我从不暴饮暴食；]\nI never get addicted to games.\n[我从不沉迷游戏；]",
  "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:45:23.651084Z",
