          "end_time": 11.616,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 44.68800000000001,
          "end_time": 44.68800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "第一篇的内容是关于原则，我现在的原则：",
